  "notes": "常用功能，一目了然\n\n- 群组活动、时光回忆与套餐、钱包、签到等并列，福利顶部不再展示大推广卡片。\n- 会员总览加载中、暂无套餐或暂时不可用时，仍可打开各项功能。\n- 验证邮箱后按同后缀自动归组，10 人、50 人达标自动发奖，升级仅补差额。\n- 回忆打开即看，随时切换月度与年度；报名、提现、回忆卡保存和分享均在原生页面完成。\n- 分享卡不含邮箱、账号和现金信息；缺失数据明确提示。商店版保留时光回忆，不展示现金活动。\n",
  "notesEn": "Everyday features, together\n\n- Group rewards and Memories now sit alongside plans, wallet and check-in in the same compact feature grid. Removed the large promotional cards above the benefits page.\n- Feature shortcuts remain available while membership details load, when no plan is active or if the overview is temporarily unavailable.\n- Verify an email to join its domain group. Rewards arrive at 10 and 50 members; upgrades pay only the difference.\n- Open Memories to explore any available month or year. Join groups, request withdrawals and save or share memory cards in native pages.\n- Shared cards exclude email, account and cash details. Missing data remains clearly marked. Store editions retain Memories without cash activities.\n",
